msgstr "AT puerto serie"

msgid "Detected USB/ACM serial ports. For Quectel EC200A use /dev/ttyUSB2; /dev/ttyUSB0 is the diagnostic port and does not answer AT commands."
msgstr "Puertos seriales USB leti' ACM detectados. Utia'al u Quectel EC200A meyaj /dev/ttyUSB2; /dev/ttyUSB0 leti' le puerto diagnóstico yéetel ma' núukik le comandos AT."

