msgstr "Modo experto — ku cha'ik u k'e'exel modo USB yéetel NAT"

msgid "Changing USB mode can disconnect the modem and SSH. Use only with local access or a rollback plan."
msgstr "U k'e'exel modo USB je'el u páajtal u desconectar le módem yéetel SSH. Meyaj chéen yéetel muuk' local wa jump'éel plan rollback."

